  "description": "Recep Hong, the organization’s second-in-command, returns to his homeland of Korea for a rare vacation. There, he receives a mother-of-pearl box from a fortune-teller who claims it will ward off bad luck. Thinking it’s just a scam, Recep goes to sleep, but after receiving the box, strange changes begin to occur in his body...\n\n *“What is this...? ...XX?”*\n\n(Source: Bomtoon, translated)",
